/home/sat/mcrl-v025-c1c2suff-ws/.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-c3s-variants-chatgpt-package-20260908/OUTSIDE-ROUND4-CHATGPT-DEEP-RESEARCH-LITERATURE-REVIEW-2026-09-08.md:42:When slowing hurts: geometry or load can change before the next intervention; the incumbent can become infeasible; opportunities can expire; and queued demand can wait longer. In V-C there is an additional possibility: the coordinator improves a configuration at t, BASE undoes it at t+1, and the coordinator restores it at t+3. Fewer coordinator calls therefore need not mean fewer physical moves.
/home/sat/mcrl-v025-c1c2suff-ws/.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-c3s-variants-chatgpt-package-20260908/OUTSIDE-ROUND4-CHATGPT-DEEP-RESEARCH-LITERATURE-REVIEW-2026-09-08.md:59:The strongest model-mismatch warning comes from beam scheduling. Fastenbauer et al. directly compare estimated and actual interference distributions. Underestimation causes inadequate allocation and outages; overestimation wastes power or makes the optimisation infeasible. Their interference-aware greedy method can outperform a more elaborate GEO-derived model. Exact seven-beam search exceeds 200 s; with 19 beams/25 users, greedy takes about 60 ms and the adapted-GEO method 73 ms, against an intended 10 ms beam-hopping cycle. Those measurements do not establish meeting that deadline. This is beam-hopping optimisation, not MPC. Fastenbauer et al., IEEE OJCOMS 2025, §§V-C, V-E.2.
